<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN"
        "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd">
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"/>
</head>
<body>

Dear $CREATOR,

This email is to notify that Fixed Asset Count was conducted by $USER on $DATE.
Attached is the result of company fixed asset count.

<span style="text-align: center">
    <p style="font-size:20px;color:#0066FF;font-weight:bold">$COMPANY_NAME</p>
    <p style="font-size:17px">
    	Fixed Asset Count Results<br/><br/>
        $DATE
    </p>
</span>

<table align="center" style="margin-top:50px">
	<tr>
    	<th style="font-weight:bold;width:170px">Asset Code</th>
        <th style="font-weight:bold;width:170px">Asset Name</th>
        <th style="font-weight:bold;width:170px">Asset Category</th>
        <th style="font-weight:bold;width:170px">Asset Status</th>
	</tr>

    #foreach($fa in $FIXED_ASSETS)
    <tr>
    	<td>$fa.code</td>
    	<td>$fa.name</td>
    	<td>$fa.account.name</td>
    	<td>$fa.status</td>
    </tr>
    #end
</table>
</body>
</html>